"P3949920269" "Those freakin' Snakes get in everywhere! I just got a call from Larry the Eyes, owner of a local casino called the Tiki Lounge. Apparently there's a whole slew of snakes who have come pourin' into the place, wreckin' everything! Larry pays me good 'protection money' to keep his place safe from Snakes so if I don't do something about the rampage I'll lose one of my 'clients'. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Larry's Tiki Lounge and clear out the Snakes.</A>"
